  "m_dialogList": {
    "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.ActorDialogList, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
    "m_dialogs": [
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Prep",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "He organized the Great Houses and keeps them under control through fear and manipulation. There are also tales of experiments. Nasty stuff.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_064.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "So it makes sense he's trying to find the Scholomance. Supposedly, it's an ancient academy of magic. And I mean... ANCIENT.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_065.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Before spell cards, before incantations, when magic was more than ever an expression of pure will, the instructors there discovered things.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_066.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "Some say they were on the cutting edge, playing with the six fundamental schools, Shadow Magic, even early attempts at Spell Weaving.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_067.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But they did this through experimentation on unwilling subjects, things so dark it's said Bartleby himself turned away in disgust.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_068.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "If magic is an expression of will, the Scholomance is its most sadistic and amoral utterance, a power that corrupts the soul of the user.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_069.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "For generations it was lost, until a traveling mystic happened upon it. It twisted his mind until he unleashed the Curse that changed Darkmoor forever.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_070.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "The mystic disappeared, no one found the Scholomance since... well, until Keziah... I think. She was always cagey about it.",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_071.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          },
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-BLACK-NPC-001_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "But we should get going. Whether she knows the way to the Scholomance or not, we have to save her and the others!",
            "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_VampireHunterF_A_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Velma_von_Venkman_DM-OUT_072.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1700033,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "m_dialogTag": "Complete",
        "m_dialogEntries": [
          {
            "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
            "m_personaName": "DM-MORT-NPC05_Persona",
            "m_nameOverride": "",
            "m_nameSTKey": null,
            "m_guiDisplay": "",
            "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
            "m_invisible": false,
            "m_requirements": null,
            "m_dialog": "I just sort of *sniff sniff* followed your trail to the camp, Wizard. You led me to your friends and now they led you to me.",
            "m_picture": "|_Shared|WorldData|GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_AngryMob_C_NPC.dds",
            "m_soundFile": "Sound/Dialogue/DM_1.590/Bruno_DM-OUT_022.mp3",
            "m_action": "",
            "m_dialogEvent": "",
            "m_actorTemplateID": 1687161,
            "m_cameraName": ""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
